(0,30,'<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" data-en-clipboard=\"true\">The van genes that confer vancomycin resistance are primarily found in certain species of bacteria belonging to the Enterococcus genus. Enterococcus species are Gram-positive bacteria that are part of the normal flora in the human intestines and can also cause infections, especially in healthcare settings. The van genes encode enzymes that modify the bacterial cell wall precursors, leading to reduced binding of vancomycin and rendering the bacteria resistant to the antibiotic.</div>','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-26 00:08:27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(0,31,'<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" data-en-clipboard=\"true\">The van genes that confer vancomycin resistance are primarily found in certain species of bacteria belonging to the Enterococcus genus. Enterococcus species are Gram-positive bacteria that are part of the normal flora in the human intestines and can also cause infections, especially in healthcare settings. The van genes encode enzymes that modify the bacterial cell wall precursors, leading to reduced binding of vancomycin and rendering the bacteria resistant to the antibiotic.</div>','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-26 00:08:27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(0,48,'<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" data-en-clipboard=\"true\">The van genes that confer vancomycin resistance are primarily found in certain species of bacteria belonging to the Enterococcus genus. Enterococcus species are Gram-positive bacteria that are part of the normal flora in the human intestines and can also cause infections, especially in healthcare settings. The van genes encode enzymes that modify the bacterial cell wall precursors, leading to reduced binding of vancomycin and rendering the bacteria resistant to the antibiotic.</div>','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-26 00:08:27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
