(24,'Enterococcus faecium','Facultative anaerobic, gram-positive bacteria. Component of normal colonic flora and ubiquitous in the environment. A common cause of uncomplicated, complicated, and recurrent UTIs, often catheter or instrumentation-associated.\nIntrinsic resistance to TMP-SMX and Aminoglycosides.\nPossible resistance to Macrolides, Beta-Lactams.\nCommon plasmid-mediated resistance to Vancomycin (vanA, VanB).\nPlease note: Fluoroquinolone resistance may occur without the regular Qnr markers due to chromosomal mutations and other mechanisms.\nPlease Note: Infectious disease consultation is recommended for complicated Vancomycin-resistant infections.','Amoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nLinezolid.\nDaptomycin.\nVancomycin.\n',1,'NULL','','Amoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nLinezolid.\nDaptomycin.\nVancomycin.\n','Amoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nLinezolid.\nDaptomycin.\nVancomycin.\n','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','Amoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nLinezolid.\nDaptomycin.\nVancomycin.\n','Amoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nLinezolid.\nDaptomycin.\nVancomycin.\n','Amoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nLinezolid.\nDaptomycin.\nVancomycin.\n','','','','','Linezolid. \nDaptomycin.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nAmoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\n\n','Linezolid. \nDaptomycin.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nAmoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\n\n','Linezolid. \nDaptomycin.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nAmoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\n\n','Linezolid. \nDaptomycin.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nAmoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\n\n','Amoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\nNitrofurantoin.\nFosfomycin.\nLinezolid.\nDaptomycin.\nVancomycin.','Amoxicillin.\nAmoxicillin-Clavulanate.\nNitrofurantoin.\nF