(9,'Vicodin','HYDROCODONE > Cutoff','HYDROCODONE','2-4 days','6 to 24 hours','Cutoff','Parent medication available by prescription, e.g. Norco®; its metabolites are required to conclude consumption.\r\n',NULL),
(10,'Hydrocodone','HYDROCODONE > Cutoff','HYDROCODONE','2-4 days','6 to 24 hours','Cutoff','Parent medication available by prescription, e.g. Norco®; its metabolites are required to conclude consumption.\r\n',NULL),
(11,'Lorcet','HYDROCODONE > Cutoff','HYDROCODONE','2-4 days','6 to 24 hours','Cutoff','Presence of Hydrocodone indicates the use of Hydrocodone (e.g. Vicodin, Norco) containing drug or as a minor metabolite of Codeine. It also metabolizes into Norhydrocodone and further into Dihydrocodeine and Hydromorphone. *May also be detected in low concentrations as an impurity due to high concentrations of Oxycodone.',NULL),
