(40,'Morphine','MORPHINE > Cutoff','MORPHINE','2-4 days','6 to 24 hours','Cutoff','Presence of Morphine indicates the use of a Morphine (e.g. MSContin) containing drug, poppy seeds or by metabolism of Codeine or Heroin. It also metabolizes  into Hydromorphone. * Morphine is also a major metabolite of Heroin (6-MAM) and Heroin is rapidly metabolized into Morphine. Therefore, the absence of 6-MAM and presence of Morphine, does not rule out the use of Heroin.',NULL),
(41,'Avinza','MORPHINE > Cutoff','MORPHINE','2-4 days','6 to 24 hours','Cutoff','Presence of Morphine indicates the use of a Morphine (e.g. MSContin) containing drug, poppy seeds or by metabolism of Codeine or Heroin. It also metabolizes  into Hydromorphone. * Morphine is also a major metabolite of Heroin (6-MAM) and Heroin is rapidly metabolized into Morphine. Therefore, the absence of 6-MAM and presence of Morphine, does not rule out the use of Heroin.',NULL),
