(333,NULL,'BUPRENORPHINE > Cutoff','Cutoff',' 4-5 days','',NULL,'Presence of Buprenorphine indicates the use of a Buprenorphine-containing drugs (e.g. Suboxone and Buprenex). It also   metabolizes into Norbuprenorphine.',NULL),
