(14,'pcr',0,27,'This test has been approved by the Federal Drug Administration (FDA) and is considered acceptable under CLIA waived standards. The information contained within this report is intended to be interpreted by a licensed physician or other licensed health care professionals. Results obtained from this test are designed for preliminary screening only and are not intended to replace diagnostic procedures such as barium enema, colonoscopy, proctosigmoidoscopy examination or other X-ray studies. The test should not be considered as conclusive evidence for the presence or absence of gastrointestinal bleeding or pathology.','0000-00-00','0000-00-00','2023-07-19 00:00:18',1,'');
