(47,'Rapid COVID-19 IgG/IgM Antibody Test',0,1,'blood',0,'',NULL,NULL,'This test has not been reviewed by the FDA. The results are for reference only and should not be the sole basis for diagnosis and treatment. Negative results do not rule out acute or historic SARS-COV-2 infection. Positive results may be due to past or present infection with non-SARS-CoV-2 coronavirus strains, such as coronavirus HKU1, NL63, OC43, or 229E and should be confirmed by other confirmatory methods. Confirmatory testing for acute SARS-COV-2 via nasal/nasopharyngeal swab would require a nasal/nasopharyngeal swab and could not be added on to or performed by serology testing.',0,0,1,'','',0,'','',0,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0),
