(494,'SARS-CoV-2 IgG',0,0,0,'',44,'blood','',1,0,'','0000-00-00','0000-00-00','',0,'','','','','CoV-2 IgG',NULL,'94507-1',1,'',0,0,0,'','162','CoV-2 IgG - SARS-CoV-2 Antibody','IgG','The SARS-CoV-2 IgG assay is only for use under the Food and Drug Administration\'s Emergency Use Authorization. Results from antibody testing should not be\r\nused as the sole basis to diagnose or exclude the presence or history of SARS-CoV-2 infection or to inform of infection status. Negative results do not rule out the\r\npresence or history of SARS-CoV-2 infection; testing with a molecular diagnostic assay should be considered to evaluate individuals suspicious of active SARSCoV-2 infection if warranted. False positive results for SARS-CoV-2 IgG assay may occur due to cross-reactivity from pre-existing antibodies or other possible\r\ncauses. Immunocompromised patients who have COVID-19 may have a delayed antibody response and produce levels of antibodies which may not be detected\r\nas positive by the IgG antibody assay..',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,13,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),
(495,'SARS-CoV-2 IgM',0,0,0,'',44,'blood','',0,0,'','0000-00-00','0000-00-00','',0,'','','','','CoV-2 IgM',NULL,'94564-2',1,'',0,0,0,'','447','CoV-2 IgM - SARS-CoV-2 Antibody','IgM','The AdviseDx SARS-CoV-2 IgM assay is only for use under the Food and Drug Administration’s Emergency Use Authorization. The AdviseDx SARS-CoV-2 IgM assay is intended for use as an aid in identifying individuals with an adaptive immune response to SARS-CoV-2, indicating recent or prior infection. Results from antibody testing should not be used as the sole basis to diagnose or exclude the presence or history of SARS-CoV-2 infection or to inform of infection status. False positive results for the AdviseDx SARS-CoV-2 IgM assay may occur due to cross-reactivity from pre-existing antibodies or other possible causes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,13,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,0),
