(22683,'ci_notes_result_pcr','a:6:{s:8:\"pdf_logo\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"result_imagenote\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"result_image\";s:0:\"\";i:1;s:640:\"<br><i>Disclaimer: This test was developed, and its performance characteristics determined by Arc Diagnostics. It has not been cleared or approved by the US Food and Drug Administration (FDA). The FDA does not require this test to go through premarket FDA review. This test is used for clinical purposes. It should not be regarded as investigational or for research. This laboratory is certified under the Clinical Laboratory Improvement Amendments (CLIA) as qualified to perform high complexity clinical laboratory testing. These panels detect the presences of pathogens and must be evaluated with clinical symptoms to diagnose disease</i>\";s:8:\"rejectin\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"abx_below\";s:1342:\"<div style=\\\"font-size:9px;padding-top:5px;\\\">Disclaimer: This test was developed, and its performance characteristics determined by ARC Diagnostics Laboratory. It has not been cleared or approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration. The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary. This test is used for clinical purpose. It should not be regarded as investigational or for research. This laboratory is certified under the Clinical Laboratory Improvement Amendments of 1988 (CLIA-88) as qualified to perform high complexity clinical laboratory testing. This test reflects the result of antibiotic resistance on a genotypic level and does not reflect the phenotypic nature of resistances found in any way. Any information contained within this report does not in any way constitute a recommendation for treatment. This report is an algorithmic calculation based solely on the antibiotics of choice for pathogens and resistance markers presently identified. This test and report do not take into consideration of the following: other possible pathogens or antibiotic resistance not presently tested, patient’s age, patient’s allergies, patient’s underlying medical conditions, possible drug interactions or antibiotic stewardship guidelines. This report is to be utilized for educational purposes only.</div>\";}','yes'),
